43
00:02:52,000 --> 00:02:53,000
 the Terbon bike path.

44
00:02:53,000 --> 00:02:58,000
 But let's rest assured that this is not the only topic of discussion in our borough.

45
00:02:58,000 --> 00:03:02,000
 And as it seems, social media is not real life,

46
00:03:02,000 --> 00:03:06,000
 and the discussion in person was very cordial and reasonable.

47
00:03:06,000 --> 00:03:09,000
 And when we have time to express ourselves in a proper manner,

48
00:03:09,000 --> 00:03:11,000
 then we can find a proper compromise.

49
00:03:11,000 --> 00:03:14,000
 And I think this is the path that we're trying to find with our administration,

50
00:03:14,000 --> 00:03:16,000
 a very pragmatic, reasonable approach.

51
00:03:16,000 --> 00:03:21,000
 I know this is not the approach that was pushed forward by our predecessors,

52
00:03:21,000 --> 00:03:24,000
 and that's really unfortunate because they really polarize the population

53
00:03:24,000 --> 00:03:27,000
 in a way that is not constructive for our population,

54
00:03:27,000 --> 00:03:31,000
 and even is not constructive for active mobility in the borough.

55
00:03:31,000 --> 00:03:34,000
 And this is definitely our goal here,

56
00:03:34,000 --> 00:03:38,000
 is to find a proper compromise that will enable safe mobility for all,

57
00:03:38,000 --> 00:03:42,000
 and also more confident in quality of life in a way that we respect our residents

58
00:03:42,000 --> 00:03:45,000
 who express themselves before the elections and after,

59
00:03:45,000 --> 00:03:46,000
 saying that they need change.

60
00:03:46,000 --> 00:03:49,000
