61
00:03:49,000 --> 00:03:56,000
 we have years of daily counting data from counters across the borough and the city.

62
00:03:56,000 --> 00:03:57,000
 It's not weak data.

63
00:03:57,000 --> 00:03:58,000
 We've done a recent campaign.

64
00:03:58,000 --> 00:04:01,000
 We went door to door, 4,000 doors.

65
00:04:01,000 --> 00:04:03,000
 So this is not weak data.

66
00:04:03,000 --> 00:04:06,000
